cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Thunderball: DISCO VOLANTE — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  BOND film package implementing deterministic special-agent mission software
  for the underwater nuclear-recovery operation from Thunderball (1965): dive
  planning (Bühlmann ZH-L16A decompression, air budget), NATO convoy integrity
  analysis, submersible range/endurance logistics, passive-sonar detection,
  set-and-drift navigation, and convoy interdiction, exposed through the frozen
  bond_api MissionProvider protocol.
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
    affiliation: "Active Inference Institute"
keywords:
  - dive planning
  - Bühlmann ZH-L16A decompression
  - no-decompression limit
  - convoy integrity
  - escort coverage
  - submersible logistics
  - passive sonar
  - Thorp absorption
  - set-and-drift navigation
  - closest point of approach
  - convoy interdiction
  - deterministic mission software
